---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Case Studies | Blooming Systems Inc."
  description="Explore identity and technology case studies covering hybrid identity, automated joiner-mover-leaver lifecycle management, identity governance, and enterprise access management."
>
  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="case-hero">
      <div class="page-container">
        <p class="section-eyebrow">CASE STUDIES</p>

        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div>
            <h1>
              Identity and technology
              <span>in practice.</span>
            </h1>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p>
              Enterprise identity environments require more than
              authentication alone. The right architecture connects
              access management, identity governance, lifecycle
              automation, and compliance across the entire technology
              estate.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURED CASE STUDY -->
    <section class="case-study">
      <div class="page-container">
        <div class="case-label">
          <span>FEATURED CASE STUDY</span>
          <span>HYBRID IDENTITY</span>
        </div>

        <div class="case-heading">
          <p class="section-eyebrow">MICROSOFT ENTRA ID + SAILPOINT</p>

          <h2>
            Hybrid Identity &amp; Automated
            <span>JML Lifecycle Management</span>
          </h2>

          <p class="case-intro">
            A representative enterprise identity architecture in which
            Microsoft Entra ID provides the primary access and identity
            provider layer while SailPoint operates as the identity
            governance and administration engine.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- CONTEXT -->
        <div class="content-section">
          <div class="content-label">
            <span>01</span>
            <strong>EXECUTIVE CONTEXT</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="content-body">
            <div class="context-grid">
              <div class="context-card">
                <span>INDUSTRY</span>
                <strong>
                  Financial Services / Enterprise Healthcare /
                  Global Manufacturing
                </strong>
              </div>

              <div class="context-card">
                <span>ORGANIZATION SIZE</span>
                <strong>10,000–50,000+ employees and contractors</strong>
              </div>

              <div class="context-card context-card-wide">
                <span>CORE CHALLENGE</span>
                <p>
                  The organization relies on Microsoft Entra ID for
                  Single Sign-On and conditional access, but requires
                  deeper governance across cloud, on-premises, SaaS,
                  ERP, database, and legacy application environments.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ARCHITECTURE -->
        <div class="content-section architecture-section">
          <div class="content-label">
            <span>02</span>
            <strong>CORE ARCHITECTURE</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="content-body">
            <p class="section-description">
              Rather than competing for the same role, Entra ID and
              SailPoint operate as complementary tiers within the
              identity architecture.
            </p>

            <div class="architecture">
              <div class="architecture-source">
                <span class="architecture-kicker">AUTHORITATIVE SOURCE</span>
                <strong>HR System</strong>
                <small>Workday / SAP SuccessFactors</small>
              </div>

              <div class="architecture-connector"></div>

              <div class="architecture-hub">
                <span class="architecture-kicker">IGA HUB</span>
                <strong>SailPoint</strong>
                <small>
                  Governance · Approvals · SoD · Provisioning
                </small>
              </div>

              <div class="architecture-branches">
                <div class="architecture-target">
                  <span>ACCESS &amp; IDENTITY</span>
                  <strong>Microsoft Entra ID</strong>
                  <small>
                    SSO · MFA · Conditional Access · Group Sync
                  </small>
                </div>

                <div class="architecture-target">
                  <span>ENTERPRISE ESTATE</span>
                  <strong>Legacy / On-Prem / SaaS</strong>
                  <small>
                    SAP · Database · Epic · AD · Other Applications
                  </small>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="division-table">
              <div class="table-row table-header">
                <span>DOMAIN</span>
                <span>MICROSOFT ENTRA ID</span>
                <span>SAILPOINT</span>
              </div>

              <div class="table-row">
                <span>Primary Role</span>
                <span>
                  Authentication, SSO, Conditional Access, MFA
                </span>
                <span>
                  Access Requests, Entitlement Management, SoD
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="table-row">
                <span>Scope</span>
                <span>
                  Cloud applications, SaaS, Azure resources, AD Sync
                </span>
                <span>
                  Enterprise-wide cloud, on-premises, ERP and legacy
                  systems
                </span>
              </div>

              <div class="table-row">
                <span>User Lifecycle</span>
                <span>
                  Real-time authentication and access enforcement
                </span>
                <span>
                  Onboarding, role changes, approvals and
                  de-provisioning workflows
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- JML -->
        <div class="content-section">
          <div class="content-label">
            <span>03</span>
            <strong>JOINER · MOVER · LEAVER</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="content-body">
            <p class="section-description">
              Automated lifecycle management connects authoritative HR
              events to identity governance and downstream access
              controls.
            </p>

            <div class="lifecycle-grid">
              <!-- JOINER -->
              <article class="lifecycle-card">
                <div class="lifecycle-number">01</div>

                <p class="lifecycle-label">JOINER</p>

                <h3>Automated onboarding</h3>

                <ol>
                  <li>
                    A new employee is added to the authoritative HR
                    system.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    SailPoint evaluates attributes such as department,
                    title, and location.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Identity and role-based access rules determine
                    appropriate birthright access.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    The required account is provisioned into Entra ID
                    and other enterprise applications.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Entra ID applies the organization's authentication
                    and access policies.
                  </li>
                </ol>
              </article>

              <!-- MOVER -->
              <article class="lifecycle-card">
                <div class="lifecycle-number">02</div>

                <p class="lifecycle-label">MOVER</p>

                <h3>Controlled role transitions</h3>

                <ol>
                  <li>
                    A change in department, title, or role is detected
                    from the HR system.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    SailPoint evaluates the user's new access profile.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Separation-of-Duties rules identify conflicting
                    combinations of access.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Existing entitlements are revoked while new
                    access is provisioned.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Higher-risk access can be routed through manager
                    approval workflows.
                  </li>
                </ol>
              </article>

              <!-- LEAVER -->
              <article class="lifecycle-card">
                <div class="lifecycle-number">03</div>

                <p class="lifecycle-label">LEAVER</p>

                <h3>Rapid offboarding</h3>

                <ol>
                  <li>
                    A termination or separation event is received from
                    the HR system.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    SailPoint initiates downstream de-provisioning.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Entra ID access is disabled and active access
                    sessions can be revoked.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Access to SaaS, cloud, legacy, and on-premises
                    applications is removed.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    The resulting activity is available for governance
                    and audit purposes.
                  </li>
                </ol>
              </article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ACCESS CERTIFICATION -->
        <div class="content-section certification-section">
          <div class="content-label">
            <span>04</span>
            <strong>ACCESS CERTIFICATION</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="content-body">
            <div class="split-content">
              <div>
                <h3>
                  Continuous governance across
                  <span>the identity estate.</span>
                </h3>
              </div>

              <div>
                <p>
                  SailPoint can aggregate identity, group membership,
                  directory roles, and entitlement information from
                  Entra ID and other connected systems.
                </p>

                <p>
                  Automated access certification campaigns can then
                  route reviews to managers and resource owners.
                  Decisions to remove access can trigger downstream
                  changes, while the governance platform maintains an
                  audit trail.
                </p>

                <ul class="feature-list">
                  <li>Manager and resource-owner certifications</li>
                  <li>Entitlement and group membership reviews</li>
                  <li>Separation-of-Duties controls</li>
                  <li>Automated remediation workflows</li>
                  <li>Audit-ready governance records</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- OUTCOMES -->
        <div class="outcomes-section">
          <div class="content-label">
            <span>05</span>
            <strong>MEASURED OUTCOMES</strong>
          </div>

          <div class="outcomes-grid">
            <div class="outcome">
              <strong>80%+</strong>
              <span>Potential reduction in onboarding time</span>
            </div>

            <div class="outcome">
              <strong>Zero-Day</strong>
              <span>De-provisioning objective following termination</span>
            </div>

            <div class="outcome">
              <strong>70%</strong>
              <span>
                Potential reduction in audit preparation time
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="outcome-note">
            Outcomes shown are representative targets from the
            described enterprise scenario and are dependent on
            implementation scope, integration maturity, and operating
            model.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="case-cta">
      <div class="page-container">
        <div>
          <p class="section-eyebrow">HAVE A SIMILAR CHALLENGE?</p>

          <h2>
            Let's build the identity
            <span>foundation together.</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

        <a href="/contact/" class="cta-button">
          Start a conversation
          <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    width: min(var(--container), calc(100% - (var(--gutter) * 2)));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* HERO */

  .case-hero {
    padding: 180px 0 130px;
    background: #eef4ff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(320px, 0.75fr);
    gap: 100px;
    align-items: end;
  }

  .case-hero h1 {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: clamp(52px, 6vw, 88px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
  }

  .case-hero h1 span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .hero-copy p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* CASE STUDY */

  .case-study {
    padding: 130px 0 0;
    background: var(--color-white);
  }

  .case-label {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
  }

  .case-heading {
    max-width: 950px;
    padding: 85px 0 115px;
  }

  .case-heading h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: clamp(44px, 5vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .case-heading h2 span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .case-intro {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 34px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* CONTENT SECTIONS */

  .content-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 250px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 70px;
    padding: 90px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .content-label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
  }

  .content-label span {
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .content-body {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .context-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .context-card {
    min-height: 190px;
    padding: 32px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .context-card-wide {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    min-height: auto;
  }

  .context-card span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
  }

  .context-card strong {
    display: block;
    max-width: 430px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .context-card p {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  /* ARCHITECTURE */

  .architecture-section {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .section-description {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 0 50px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .architecture {
    padding: 45px;
    background: var(--color-white);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .architecture-source,
  .architecture-hub,
  .architecture-target {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 26px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .architecture-source {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .architecture-hub {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
    border-color: rgba(0, 49, 255, 0.3);
    background: #eef4ff;
  }

  .architecture-kicker,
  .architecture-target span {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
  }

  .architecture strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 21px;
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .architecture small {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .architecture-connector {
    width: 1px;
    height: 45px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .architecture-branches {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 45px;
  }

  .architecture-target {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  /* TABLE */

  .division-table {
    margin-top: 45px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .table-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.7fr 1fr 1fr;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .table-row:first-child {
    border-top: 0;
  }

  .table-row span {
    padding: 22px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .table-row span:first-child {
    border-left: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 650;
  }

  .table-header span {
    color: var(--color-blue);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
  }

  /* LIFECYCLE */

  .lifecycle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .lifecycle-card {
    padding: 34px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .lifecycle-number {
    margin-bottom: 45px;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .lifecycle-label {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: 9px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: var(--tracking-label);
  }

  .lifecycle-card h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .lifecycle-card ol {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }

  .lifecycle-card li {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-left: 4px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  /* CERTIFICATION */

  .split-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: 80px;
  }

  .split-content h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3vw, 46px);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .split-content h3 span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .split-content p {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .feature-list {
    margin: 32px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .feature-list li {
    padding: 15px 0 15px 25px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: 14px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .feature-list li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    left: 0;
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    background: var(--color-blue);
  }

  /* OUTCOMES */

  .outcomes-section {
    padding: 90px 0 130px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .outcomes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin-top: 50px;
    background: var(--color-border);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .outcome {
    min-height: 230px;
    padding: 38px;
    background: var(--color-ink);
  }

  .outcome strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-blue);
    font-size: clamp(38px, 4vw, 58px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  .outcome span {
    display: block;
    max-width: 220px;
    margin-top: 25px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.76);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .outcome-note {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  /* CTA */

  .case-cta {
    padding: 110px 0;
    background: #eef4ff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .case-cta .page-container {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .case-cta h2 {
    max-width: 750px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .case-cta h2 span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--color-blue);
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 0 24px;
    color: var(--color-white);
    background: var(--color-blue);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-blue);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    font-weight: 650;
    transition:
      background 160ms ease,
      border-color 160ms ease,
      transform 160ms ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    background: var(--color-ink);
    border-color: var(--color-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .case-hero {
      padding: 150px 0 100px;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .content-section {
      grid-template-columns: 180px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 45px;
    }

    .lifecycle-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .split-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 45px;
    }

    .case-cta .page-container {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .case-hero {
      padding: 125px 0 80px;
    }

    .case-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(46px, 13vw, 68px);
    }

    .case-study {
      padding-top: 90px;
    }

    .case-label {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .case-heading {
      padding: 60px 0 80px;
    }

    .case-heading h2 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 11vw, 58px);
    }

    .content-section {
      display: block;
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .content-label {
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .context-grid,
    .architecture-branches,
    .outcomes-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .context-card-wide {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .architecture {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .table-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .table-row span {
      border-left: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    }

    .table-row span:first-child {
      border-top: 0;
    }

    .table-header {
      display: none;
    }

    .outcomes-section {
      padding: 70px 0 90px;
    }

    .case-cta {
      padding: 80px 0;
    }

    .case-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 11vw, 58px);
    }

    .cta-button {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }
</style>